{% block content %}
<main id="main-content"><section class="page-hero compact-hero"><p class="eyebrow">Trust and Accessibility</p><h1>Cookie Information</h1><p>Essential storage and optional analytics choices</p></section><section class="legal-shell"><article class="legal-card">
<p class="legal-note"><strong>Last updated: 15 July 2026.</strong> Athanas Inspires uses a small number of browser technologies to make the website work and to understand usage when permission is given.</p>
<h2>Essential browser storage</h2><p>Essential storage supports features such as audio preferences, the AI Assistant conversation saved on the device, testimonial pause settings, and the visitor’s privacy choice. These features do not require analytics permission.</p>
<h2>Optional analytics</h2><p>Google Analytics is optional. The website asks visitors to choose between “Essential Only” and “Accept Analytics.” Analytics helps identify useful pages, video clicks, downloads, assignment actions, searches, and tool usage.</p>
<h2>Changing your choice</h2><p>A visitor can clear the website’s stored data through browser settings to make a new choice. A future settings control may make this even easier. Blocking storage may prevent some preferences from being remembered.</p>
<h2>External websites</h2><p>YouTube, WhatsApp, and other external websites may use their own cookies or storage after a visitor opens their services. Athanas Inspires does not control those external technologies.</p></article></section></main>
